  "definition": "Design Approval Required",
  "effectiveDate": "2015-08-08",
  "historyNote": "#4702, eff 11-16-89; ss by #6152, INTERIM, eff 12-26-95, EXPIRED 4-24-96 New. #6333, eff 9-17-96; ss by #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07 New. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07 New. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15 New. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
